        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Evidence for ESSA catalog metadata",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "e3e363d1dd294ccb8e6ff3b76d99bc33"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "## Catalog metadata\n\n- **Steward:** Center for Research and Reform in Education, Johns Hopkins University\n- **Access:** Public searchable evidence review database\n- **Access URL:** https://evidenceforessa.org/\n- **Unit:** Reviewed K-12 program or practice\n- **Coverage:** Continuously updated reviews\n- **Update cadence:** Rolling\n- **Geography:** study-dependent\n- **Join keys:** program name, grade band, subject, study citation, ESSA evidence tier\n- **Measures:** program ratings, study citations, reading and math scope, ESSA-aligned evidence tier\n- **Uses:** evidence discovery, program screening, ESSA evidence context\n\nA review database that complements, rather than replaces, WWC and primary-study records.\n\n[Official resource](https://evidenceforessa.org/)",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "unset": []
  },
